  "instructions": [
    "Heat the iron-teppan vessel over medium heat and add the oil.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the khus khus, ferment-jang, turmeric, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the red lentils and water to the vessel, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Use a spoon to mash some of the lentils and create a thick and gooey texture.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
